        <mxCell id="footer-text" value="关键控制点: 扫描门禁(CVE拦截) → 密码学签名(不可抵赖) → 准入验证(仅允许可信镜像部署) | 工具链: Trivy + Cosign + Harbor + OPA" style="text;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0066FF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
